      "checked_original": true,
      "accessed_on": "2026-10-05",
      "inspection_note": "親讀 Embedding lines 14-264；關鍵是 indices→word embeddings、learnable (num_embeddings, embedding_dim) weight、__init__ requires_grad=not _freeze 及 forward→F.embedding。讀到的 padding/freeze 例外不當成額外勝敗結論。"
    },
    {
